<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="e0f1922c">&lt;p&gt;
    Conduct the peer review by:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Reviewing project procedures for peer reviews
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Identifying appropriate peer for code review
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Packaging functional specifications, technical specification and code into one review package
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Submitting code for review
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Discussing peer review findings
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Incorporating agreed changes into final code
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Updating technical specifications
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Re-executing unit testing for code
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Submit code for transport to test environment(s)&lt;br /&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
